# RNA Model – Data and Reproducibility Notes

This directory contains the code and processed data used to generate the RNA model figures presented in the manuscript.

## Repository contents

- `RNA_revised_master.ipynb` — analysis and figure-generation notebook.
- `plot_a/`, `plot_d/`, and `samVDD/` — processed datasets required to reproduce the published figures.

## Data files

The notebook uses the following processed datasets:

- `plot_a/plot_a_files/Plot_A_RNA_L18_Billion_Samples.csv`
- `plot_a/plot_a_files/Plot_A_RNA_L30_Billion_Samples.csv`
- `samVDD/RNA_complexity_data.dat`
- `plot_d/plot_d_files/RNA_L30_k_scaled_1_for_plot_D.csv`

These files are included in the repository and are sufficient to reproduce all figures generated by the notebook.

## Notes

The notebook does not perform preprocessing of raw simulation outputs. All analyses are based on the processed datasets included in this repository.
